# Boiling Rock Rioter: "you may cast an Ally spell from among cards you own exiled with this creature": one spell, not one for each card, and the cards
# were exiled for good, not only until the Rioter leaves (it is no Oblivion Ring). On turn 3 and turn 5 the Rioter taps itself, its only Ally then, to exile
# an Earth Kingdom Protectors and a Gran-Gran that Bot1's own Lightning Bolts killed; it does not attack either turn. Turn 7 it attacks with Mox Pearl
# and Mox Sapphire untapped, so both exiled Allies could be paid for: Bot1 chooses Gran-Gran, casts it for {U}, and is not offered the Protectors.
# Turn 8 Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the Rioter and the Protectors stays in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Boiling Rock Rioter
Earth Kingdom Protectors
Gran-Gran
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Boiling Rock Rioter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Earth Kingdom Protectors.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gran-Gran.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Earth Kingdom Protectors)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Boiling Rock Rioter.Activate(Ability: Tap an untapped Ally; Bot1.Graveyard.Earth Kingdom Protectors)
Bot1.Choose(Boiling Rock Rioter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Earth Kingdom Protectors
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Gran-Gran)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Boiling Rock Rioter.Activate(Ability: Tap an untapped Ally; Bot1.Graveyard.Gran-Gran)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Exile = Earth Kingdom Protectors; Gran-Gran
[T7 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Boiling Rock Rioter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Gran-Gran)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gran-Gran.Types = Creature
? Exile = Earth Kingdom Protectors
[T8 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Boiling Rock Rioter)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Boiling Rock Rioter; Lightning Bolt; Lightning Bolt
Exile = Earth Kingdom Protectors
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Tapped = false
